<title>FRANCE: Cerus suspended limit-down again.</title>
<headline>Cerus suspended limit-down again.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cerus shares were suspended limit-down for a second time on Tuesday and were due to requote at 1000 GMT, a spokeswoman for the French stock exchanges association SBF said.</p>
<p>The next lower limit was 128.20 francs per share.</p>
<p>Shares in Valeo requoted at 0945 GMT after being suspended limit-down for 15 minutes.</p>
</text>
